      "content": "That's a bit too academic for a high school debate. My student needs to actually win the round, not just summarize the debate. The opposition is going to talk about \"human dignity\" and \"poverty alleviation\"—it's going to be an emotional argument. Can you give me some more aggressive, hard-hitting points that specifically attack the morality and the logic of their position? I need arguments that make the Pro-UBI side look irresponsible or even dangerous to the economy.",
